---
import PageLayout from '../../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
import { CONTACT_EMAIL, SITE_NAMES } from '../../data/site-config';
import { route } from '../../i18n/routes';
const lang = 'en';
---
<PageLayout title={`Contact – ${SITE_NAMES[lang]}`} description="Contact Combustíveis Hoje PT: report a price, a station or a Monday estimate that looks wrong. We answer by e-mail and every correction is dated on the site. No phone line." lang={lang} noindex={true} breadcrumbs={[{ label: 'Contact' }]} showAuthor={false}>
  <div class="prose prose-slate max-w-none">
    <h1>Contact</h1>
    <p>Write to <a href={`mailto:${CONTACT_EMAIL}`}>{CONTACT_EMAIL}</a>. We read everything about the prices and the sums. There is no phone line and we never call anyone.</p>
    <h2>Report an error</h2>
    <p>A price does not match the pump, a station has changed brand or closed, or Monday’s estimate looks odd? Tell us the page, the station, the day and the time. Station prices are those each station reports to the DGEG: if a station has not updated its report, the fix has to come from it, and we read the data again every day.</p>
    <h2>What we cannot do</h2>
    <p>We sell no fuel, offer no discount cards and negotiate no prices with brands. A complaint about a price charged or posted goes to the station itself, its complaints book and, where relevant, to the ENSE, which supervises the sector.</p>
    <h2>Embed the calculator</h2><p>The code is on the <a href={route('widget', lang)}>embed page</a>. Publisher and hosting: <a href={route('terms', lang)}>legal notice</a>.</p>
  </div>
</PageLayout>
